{
    "title": "AI Translate All Languages",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf10<b>AI Translate All Languages</b> can translate photo, text & voice in 100+ languages with accuracy by using the All Languages Translator.\r\n\r\n<b>AI Translate All Languages</b> is used to translate text, voice translator, translate chat, photo translator & spell checker. This app is not just language translator; it breaks language barriers and connects you to the World. Go Translate All Languages also have AI features like object detector, live translation & camera translator. Communication in any language becomes easy and smooth with All Languages Translator. \r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf1f Why Use AI Translate All Languages?</b>\r\n\r\n\u2705 All Languages Translator supports 150+ languages.\r\n\u2705 AI camera translator and translate photo features for instant translation.\r\n\u2705 Speak and translate app for instant, real-time conversations.\r\n\u2705 Translate voice and real-time voice translation for immediate understanding.\r\n\u2705 User-friendly design of Go Translate All Languages, regular updates for more AI features.\r\n\u2705 OCR Text Translator to scan text from image and translate it.\r\n\u2705 Conversation Translator feature to translate voice between two persons in real-time.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features of AI Translate All Languages</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7<b>Camera Translator for Instant Translation:</b>\r\nExperience the world differently with our AI Photo Translator. Point your device at text like menus, documents, or signboard - and get an instant text translation. You can import images from gallery and translate them with All Languages Translator.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f<b>Conversations with Speak and Translate:</b>\r\nOur speak and translate app allows you to have quick and efficient conversations in any language.  Voice communication with foreign persons has never been easier, that's why thanks to AI Translate All Languages your personal language translation tool to cover your daily chats & international meetings at your fingertips.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\udcda Learn Languages:</b>\r\nEnhance your language learning skills with AI Translate All Languages. All Languages Translator app offers built-in phrasebook that helps you learn new words, making language learning part of your daily routine. Go Translate All Languages revolutionizes the way we communicate by offering a comprehensive suite of translations.\r\n\r\n<b>Go translate all languages</b> app supports 100+ languages, some of the famous ones are as follows:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb Spanish Translator\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb English Translator\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb Japanese Translator\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb Arabic Translator\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb Russian Translator\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb Hindi Translator\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2 Download <b>AI Translate All Languages</b> now and enjoy easy conversations with All Languages Translate App.",
